Three names cxx1 emits and cl does not, none differing: the constexpr functions half, sq and pick, which cl folds at every call and inlines away - the COMDAT difference every other .nocl in this directory records, here for functions that are constexpr as well as inline-by-definition. The four constexpr doubles are file-local on both sides. What the case is about - that a constexpr call folds inside a floating constant expression (A11) - is checked by run-cases.cmd's output.
